{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17388","headline":"奉和陈阁老寒食初假当直从东省往集贤因过史馆看木瓜花寄张蒋二阁老 · 权德舆","name":"奉和陈阁老寒食初假当直从东省往集贤因过史馆看木瓜花寄张蒋二阁老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昼漏沈沈倦琐闱，西垣东观阅芳菲。\n繁花满树似留客，应爲主人休澣归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}